WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.257 --> 00:00:04.241
- What's up, Believe Nation?

00:00:04.241 --> 00:00:06.310
I need your help in
picking the next Top 10's

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:07.669
that are coming out on the channel,

00:00:07.669 --> 00:00:11.836
and this is the video where
you can leave your requests.

00:00:18.694 --> 00:00:21.506
So, we've done hundreds of
Top 10's on this channel,

00:00:21.506 --> 00:00:23.955
hundreds and hundreds and
hundreds, maybe thousands.

00:00:23.955 --> 00:00:25.670
I'll have to see how many
we've done for Top 10's.

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.644
And most of them now have
been coming from you guys,

00:00:27.644 --> 00:00:28.793
from your feedback,

00:00:28.793 --> 00:00:30.943
and when you're leaving
comments on different videos,

00:00:30.943 --> 00:00:31.875
we collect them.

00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:35.067
We start adding up who's getting
the most number of votes.

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:37.517
And we're at the point
where we have 2,000 to 3,000

00:00:37.517 --> 00:00:40.171
more requests that are in our backlog,

00:00:40.171 --> 00:00:42.497
and I want to make it easier for everybody

00:00:42.497 --> 00:00:44.092
to help pick the next Top 10's.

00:00:44.092 --> 00:00:45.866
So, here's what we're going to do.

00:00:45.866 --> 00:00:50.174
This is the video that we're
going to pick the Top 10's from.

00:00:50.174 --> 00:00:52.667
If you have somebody that
you would like to vote for

00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:56.332
to see a next Top 10
or a Top 10 Volume Two,

00:00:56.332 --> 00:00:58.276
maybe Volume Three or beyond,

00:00:58.276 --> 00:00:59.815
leave it down in the comments below,

00:00:59.815 --> 00:01:00.923
and what we're going to do

00:01:00.923 --> 00:01:03.527
is the ones that have the most thumbs ups,

00:01:03.527 --> 00:01:05.088
the ones that get voted up the most,

00:01:05.088 --> 00:01:06.960
are going to be the ones
that we look at next

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:09.647
for making a Top 10 on the channel.

00:01:09.647 --> 00:01:10.922
And so, instead of leaving comments

00:01:10.922 --> 00:01:12.524
all over the different
videos on the channel,

00:01:12.524 --> 00:01:14.192
this is the single video

00:01:14.192 --> 00:01:16.380
where all the comments will be aggregated.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:18.515
This is the one that
we're paying attention to.

00:01:18.515 --> 00:01:20.030
So, leave the comments down,

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:21.832
whoever you want to see a next Top 10 on

00:01:21.832 --> 00:01:25.129
or Volume Two, Three, Four,
Five, wherever we get to,

00:01:25.129 --> 00:01:27.388
and if you see ones that you like,

00:01:27.388 --> 00:01:29.659
give it a thumbs up, give it a vote

00:01:29.659 --> 00:01:31.907
because those are going to
be the ones that rise up

00:01:31.907 --> 00:01:34.206
and we're going to pick to do them next.

00:01:34.206 --> 00:01:35.399
So, thank you for your support.

00:01:35.399 --> 00:01:37.706
I'm super curious to see
how this challenge goes,

00:01:37.706 --> 00:01:40.378
and I look forward to seeing
who you guys want to see next

00:01:40.378 --> 00:01:42.128
in the Top 10 series.

